<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE TENNIS-EUROPEAN TOP 12 TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TABLE TENNIS-EUROPEAN TOP 12 TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the</p>
<p>European Top 12 table tennis tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>Vladimir Samsonov (Belarus) beat Zoran Primorac (Croatia) 21-12</p>
<p>24-22 15-21 21-17</p>
<p>Jean-Philippe Gatien (France) beat Jan-Ove Waldner (Sweden)</p>
<p>21-16 18-21 21-16 13-21 21-11</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>Ni Xia Lian (Luxembourg) beat Otilia Badescu (Romania)</p>
<p>21-11 15-21 21-12 21-12</p>
<p>Jie Schopp (Germany) beat Olga Nemes (Germany) 18-21 21-14</p>
<p>21-10 21-19</p>
<p>Finals:</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>Gatien beat Samsonov 21-15 13-21 21-19 15-21 21-18</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>Ni Xia Lian beat Schopp 19-21 21-18 21-13 21-8</p>
</text>
